ni-assembly-mcp
===============

This project is a port of parliament-mcp to the Northern Ireland Assembly
Open Data API.

Original work:
    parliament-mcp
    https://github.com/i-dot-ai/parliament-mcp
    Copyright (c) 2025 i.AI
    MIT License
    Ported from upstream commit 2db3fe4.

A read-only copy of the upstream project at that commit is vendored under
reference/parliament-mcp/ for porting reference and is not part of the
distributed package.

Data sources (retrieved at runtime; not redistributed by this project):

  * Northern Ireland Assembly Open Data API — data.niassembly.gov.uk
    Subject to the Assembly's own copyright / reuse terms.

  * (Phase 6b, planned) TheyWorkForYou / mySociety — theyworkforyou.com,
    github.com/mysociety/parlparse
    Member and speaker identity data under CC BY-SA 2.5; debate text under the
    Open Parliament Licence. Attribution: "Data service provided by
    TheyWorkForYou" (https://www.theyworkforyou.com). See PLAN.md section 5d.

This project is not affiliated with the Northern Ireland Assembly, i.AI, or
mySociety / TheyWorkForYou.
